      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785334931907,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Testing software as developers -\n- we can test the stuff we know it is *supposed to do*\n- much harder to test for things that your app does that it isn't supposed to do.\n\n\n\nin typescript:\n    - you use 'protected' on fields in a component so that if any other code is using it\nyou are aware of it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Testing software as developers -\n- we can test the stuff we know it is *supposed to do*\n- much harder to test for things that your app does that it isn't supposed to do.\n\n\n\nin typescript:\n    - you use 'protected' on fields in a component so that if any other code is using it\nyou are aware of it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
